<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-11767] GridDhtPartitionsFullMessage retains huge maps on heap in exchange history</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-11767</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;ExchangeHistory keeps a FinishState for every topology version.&lt;br/&gt;
FinishState contains msg, which contains at least two huge maps:&lt;br/&gt;
partCntrs2 and partsSizesBytes.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We should probably strip msg, removing those two data structures before putting msg in exchFuts linked list to be stowed away.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
